        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Rockwood RM3721-630, Grooved Stainless Steel Door Pull Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary Grooved Door Pull Back to Back Pair is made of stainless steel. It has a Satin Stainless Steel finish that requires little maintenance. The Rockwood LineaMax Collection Grooved Door Pull With Flat Ends is designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired. The Rockwood RM3721-12-630 comes packaged as a set of two pulls and the hardware to Back-to-Back mount them.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Rockwood RM3721 Fully Grooved Straight Pulls with Flat Ends:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finishes: Satin Stainless Steel </li> \r\n<li>Pull Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Custom item. NO Returns</b>\r\n</p>",
